> tests are still failing with "apiRequestContext.get: The "options" or "port" or "path" argument must be specified"

Fixed in commit 675dbe4. The issue was that the WHATWG URL API returns an empty string (`""`) for the port property when no port is specified, while HTTP libraries expect `undefined`. I've added `|| undefined` conversion to handle this correctly.

